# Motion Design Studio

Read `skills/motion-design-studio/SKILL.md` in full before using it.

Quick reference:
- Setup once: `bash skills/creative-studio/scripts/bootstrap.sh`; prove it: `bash skills/motion-design-studio/scripts/selftest.sh`.
- Always start with `motion_plan` (engine + reasons + spec skeleton); default engine `motion_compose` (spec or `template=`).
- Iterate with `"preview": true` at 720p; LOOK at stills/contact sheet/key frames; final 1080p (4K on request), `motion_blur` for fast moves, alpha MOV/WebM for editors.
- Stack text with `id` + `below/above` + `gap` (measured heights) — never guess y for wrapped/Arabic lines. Arabic animates by word.
- Never invent copy; brand kit via `brand=<slug>`; no third-party logos; Remotion only with `licence_ok=true` (≤3 people or company licence).
